1. What you may do

You may copy, change and reuse the code and design of this website (its HTML,
CSS and JavaScript) and the 3D building models in events-3d/models/ in your own
work, as long as you follow condition 2.

2. Visible credit (required)

Any website, app or other work that uses a substantial part of this code, this
design or these 3D models must show the following credit in a place where its
visitors can see it without opening the source code, for example in the page
footer or next to the 3D scene:

